< 	\ite these microprocessor is integrated in an ``embedded PC'' or a ``PC/104-system''
< 	\ite these type of PC works without an harddisc (and without any cooling devices)
< 	\ite instead of a harddisc a ``FLASH Memory'' are used (SD-Card for example)
< 	\ite if a graphical user interface is available then the ``graphical processing unit'' is part of the microprocessor
